ver copy, mirror, rotate, translate, recolor or interpolate a static sprite. No labels, grid, captions, extra figures, scenery, opaque background, ground, shadows, detached effects, large aura or long trails. Alpha-zero outside silhouettes. This is a brief nonfatal impact and recovery, distinct from attack and death. No weapon swing toward a target, firing, casting, wounds or blood.",
